('LOC_BUILDING_ALCHEMICAL_SOCIETY_DESCRIPTION', '50% [ICON_Science]Science in this City.', 'en_US'),
('LOC_BUILDING_ANGKOR_WAT_DESCRIPTION', 'Grants a source of [ICON_RESOURCE_MANA_SUN]Sun Mana. Disciple Units trained in this city gain +16 experience. Can support a Priest and a Sage. Reveals invisible units within your borders*.', 'en_US'),
('LOC_SLTH_BUILDING_ADULARIA_CHAMBER_DESCRIPTION', 'Golems trained in this city start with the Invisible Ability.*+3%[ICON_Production].', 'en_US'),
('LOC_SLTH_BUILDING_AQUEDUCT_DESCRIPTION', 'PLACEHOLDER', 'en_US'),
('LOC_SLTH_BUILDING_ARENA_DESCRIPTION', 'PLACEHOLDER', 'en_US'),
('LOC_SLTH_BUILDING_SYNAGOGUE_DESCRIPTION', 'PLACEHOLDER BASILICA', 'en_US'),
('LOC_SLTH_BUILDING_BLASTING_WORKSHOP_DESCRIPTION', 'Golems trained in this city can cast Fireball*.+3%[ICON_Production].', 'en_US'),
('LOC_SLTH_BUILDING_CAVE_OF_ANCESTORS_DESCRIPTION', 'Amurite Unique Building. Grants 1 Experience per type of Mana owned to Magic units trained in this city.', 'en_US'),
('LOC_SLTH_BUILDING_CHANCEL_DESCRIPTION', 'Grants built units the Defensive ability.*', 'en_US'),
('LOC_SLTH_BUILDING_BIBLIOTHEQUE_DESCRIPTION', 'Reduces Maintenance of this City by 40%. +1 [ICON_Amenities]Amenity with Social Order.', 'en_US'),
('LOC_SLTH_BUILDING_FREAK_SHOW_DESCRIPTION', 'Balseraph Unique Building. Unlocked with Festivals. Grants +1 [ICON_Amenities]Amenity, +2 [ICON_Culture]Culture, and a Bard Specialist slot. Allows Slaves to be used to build Cage Buildings of the different races.', 'en_US'),
('LOC_BUILDING_GRANARY_DESCRIPTION', '20% increased Growth Rate in this city. +1[ICON_Housing] Housing for having a source of [ICON_RESOURCE_MAIZE]Corn, [ICON_RESOURCE_RICE]Rice and [ICON_RESOURCE_WHEAT]Wheat, respectively.', 'en_US'),
('LOC_SLTH_BUILDING_HALL_OF_MIRRORS_DESCRIPTION', 'Balseraph Unique Building. Unlocked with Alteration and requires a Carnival. Creates a copy of the strongest Unit adjacent to the city. The copy lasts for 3 turns.', 'en_US'),
('LOC_SLTH_BUILDING_INFIRMARY_DESCRIPTION', 'Units heal 25% faster in this city.*', 'en_US'),
('LOC_SLTH_BUILDING_MONUMENT_DESCRIPTION', 'Cheap, simple Culture Building.', 'en_US'),
('LOC_SLTH_BUILDING_PALLENS_ENGINE_DESCRIPTION', 'Golems trained in this city start with the Perfect Sight Ability, seeing Invisible Units.*+3%[ICON_Production].', 'en_US'),
('LOC_SLTH_BUILDING_PLANAR_GATE_DESCRIPTION', 'Sheaim Unique Building. Spawns special units randomly depending on other Buildings present in city, chance and number increased by the Armageddon Counter. ', 'en_US'),
('LOC_SLTH_BUILDING_SMOKEHOUSE_DESCRIPTION', '20% Growth Rate in this City. +1 Housing from [ICON_RESOURCE_CATTLE]Cow, [ICON_RESOURCE_TRUFFLES]Pig, [ICON_RESOURCE_SHEEP]Sheep and [ICON_RESOURCE_TOAD]Toad.', 'en_US'),
('LOC_SLTH_BUILDING_AMPITHEATRE_DESCRIPTION', '+1 [ICON_Amenities]Amenity for having a source of Dyes. +1 [ICON_Amenities]Amenity per 10% of [ICON_Culture]Culture converted from [ICON_Faith]Commerce.*+1 [ICON_Amenities]Amenity with the Consumption Policy.', 'en_US'),
('LOC_SLTH_BUILDING_BONE_PALACE_DESCRIPTION', 'Starts a Golden Age*. Units in the city are 50% resistant to Magic*.', 'en_US'),
('LOC_BUILDING_CITY_OF_A_THOUSAND_SLUMS_DESCRIPTION', 'Would grant allow a city to have 4 radius of working tiles, if it worked! which it doesn''t.', 'en_US'),
('LOC_SLTH_BUILDING_GREAT_LIBRARY_DESCRIPTION', 'PLACEHOLDER GREAT LIB', 'en_US'),
('LOC_SLTH_BUILDING_DESERT_UNIVERSITY_DESCRIPTION', 'PLACEHOLDER GUILD OF THE NINE', 'en_US'),
('LOC_SLTH_BUILDING_ST_BASILS_DESCRIPTION', 'PLACEHOLDER HALL OF KINGS', 'en_US'),
('LOC_SLTH_BUILDING_CRISTO_REDENTOR_DESCRIPTION', 'PLACEHOLDER SIRONA', 'en_US'),
('LOC_SLTH_BUILDING_HAGIA_SOPHIA_DESCRIPTION', 'PLACEHOLDER TEMPLE OF TEMPORANCE', 'en_US'),
('LOC_SLTH_BUILDING_ORZAGHAZ_DESCRIPTION', 'PLACEHOLDER WINTER PALACE', 'en_US'),
('LOC_BUILDING_BANK_DESCRIPTION', '25% [ICON_Gold] Gold in this City.', 'en_US'),
('LOC_BUILDING_TRAINING_YARD_DESCRIPTION', 'Required to train Axemen, Champion, Phalanx and Berserkers.[NEWLINE] +1 [ICON_Amenities]Amenity with Nationhood.', 'en_US'),
('LOC_BUILDING_TOWER_OF_COMPLACENCY_DESCRIPTION', '-10% [ICON_Production]Production to Military Units. -50% reduced Maintenance. ', 'en_US'),
('LOC_BUILDING_THEATER_OF_DREAMS_DESCRIPTION', '+1 [ICON_Amenities]Amenity per city.', 'en_US'),
('LOC_BUILDING_TEMPLE_OF_THE_ORDER_DESCRIPTION', '+10% [ICON_Production]Production towards Military Units. 20% [ICON_Culture]Culture in this City. +1 [ICON_Amenities]Amenity from [ICON_RESOURCE_INCENSE]Incense. +1 [ICON_Amenities]Amenity with the Religion Policy. Required to train Acolyte, Confessor and Crusader.', 'en_US'),
('LOC_SLTH_BUILDING_INN_DESCRIPTION', 'Units heal 25% faster in this city*. +1 Trade Route Capacity. +25 to all international Trade Route yields. +1 [ICON_Amenities]Amenity for having a source of [ICON_RESOURCE_WINE]Wine.', 'en_US'),
('LOC_SLTH_BUILDING_TOWER_OF_MASTERY_DESCRIPTION', 'Building this Wonder wins you the Tower of Mastery Victory. Requires the 4 preceding Towers, Tower of Elements, Tower of Divination, Tower of Alteration. Tower of Necromancy.', 'en_US'),
('LOC_BUILDING_TAX_OFFICE_DESCRIPTION', '25% [ICON_Gold] Gold in this City.', 'en_US'),
('LOC_BUILDING_BAZAAR_OF_MAMMON_DESCRIPTION', '100% [ICON_Gold] Gold in this City. Allows slotting 3 Merchants.', 'en_US'),
('LOC_BUILDING_GREAT_LIGHTHOUSE_DESCRIPTION', '+2 Trade Route Capacity per coastal city.', 'en_US'),
('LOC_BUILDING_GROVE_DESCRIPTION', 'Required to train Beastmasters and Druids. They also grants +2[ICON_Amenities] Amenities with the Guardian of Nature Policy.', 'en_US'),
('LOC_BUILDING_TEMPLE_OF_THE_EMPYREAN_DESCRIPTION', '10% [ICON_Science] Science in this City. 20% [ICON_Culture] Culture in this City. +1 [ICON_Amenities]Amenity from [ICON_RESOURCE_INCENSE]Incense. +1 [ICON_Amenities]Amenity with the Religion Policy. Required to build Ecclesiastic and Vicars.', 'en_US'),
('LOC_BUILDING_HERON_THRONE_DESCRIPTION', '+1 [ICON_Production]Production on Water tiles in this city.', 'en_US'),
('LOC_BUILDING_MINES_OF_GALDUR_DESCRIPTION', 'Provides +3 [ICON_RESOURCE_IRON]Iron per turn. -2 Housing. 1 Great Engineer point. Allows 3 Engineer specialists.*', 'en_US'),
('LOC_BUILDING_LIBRARY_DESCRIPTION', '25% [ICON_Science] Science in this City.+1 [ICON_Amenities]Amenity with the Scholarship Policy.', 'en_US'),
('LOC_BUILDING_LIGHTHOUSE_DESCRIPTION', '+1 Trade Route Capacity. +1 [ICON_Food] Food from Water tiles in this city.', 'en_US'),
('LOC_BUILDING_MAGE_GUILD_DESCRIPTION', 'Required to train Adepts.', 'en_US'),
('LOC_SLTH_BUILDING_TOWER_OF_ALTERATION_DESCRIPTION', 'This tower both increases your own units resistance to spells and reduces your enemies resistance to your spells*.[NEWLINE]Requires 4 Mana Resources: [ICON_RESOURCE_MANA_BODY]Body, [ICON_RESOURCE_MANA_ENCHANTMENT]Enchantment, [ICON_RESOURCE_MANA_LIFE]Life, [ICON_RESOURCE_MANA_NATURE]Nature.[NEWLINE]Required to build the Tower of Mastery, which wins the game', 'en_US'),
('LOC_SLTH_BUILDING_HUNTING_LODGE_DESCRIPTION', 'Required to train Hunters, Hawks, Rangers and Assassins. +1[ICON_Housing] Housing and +1 [ICON_Amenities] Amenity if you have a source of [ICON_RESOURCE_DEER]Deer*.', 'en_US'),
('LOC_BUILDING_MARKET_DESCRIPTION', 'Cheap easy way to bankroll a civ. Comes at a Science penalty.', 'en_US'),
('LOC_BUILDING_TEMPLE_OF_THE_OVERLORDS_DESCRIPTION', '20% [ICON_Culture] Culture in this City. Can slot an additional Sage. +1 [ICON_Amenities]Amenity from [ICON_RESOURCE_INCENSE]Incense. +1 [ICON_Amenities]Amenity with the Religion Policy. Required to train Zealot, Cultist and Stygian Guard. Allows converting Warriors to Drowns.', 'en_US'),
('LOC_SLTH_BUILDING_TOWER_OF_DIVINATION_DESCRIPTION', 'Grant a random technology.[NEWLINE]Requires 4 Mana Resources: [ICON_RESOURCE_MANA_LAW]Law, [ICON_RESOURCE_MANA_MIND]Mind, [ICON_RESOURCE_MANA_SPIRIT]Spirit, [ICON_RESOURCE_MANA_SUN]Sun.[NEWLINE]Required to build the Tower of Mastery, which wins the game', 'en_US'),
('LOC_BUILDING_BREEDING_PIT_IMPRACTICAL_DESCRIPTION', 'Increases the food available to the city, making it grow faster. Little care is given to the nutritional value or method of delivery of the food, however, and the health of the city is lowered by one.', 'en_US'),
('LOC_BUILDING_PALGUM_DESCRIPTION', '+2 Ale Luxury Resource.[NEWLINE]10% [Icon_Faith]Commerce in this city for having a source of [ICON_RESOURCE_MAIZE]Corn, [ICON_RESOURCE_RICE]Rice and [ICON_RESOURCE_WHEAT]Wheat, respectively.[NEWLINE]Must be built in a city next to a river.', 'en_US'),
('LOC_BUILDING_CATACOMB_LIBRALUS_DESCRIPTION', 'Grants a free Mage Guild in all cities.', 'en_US'),
('LOC_BUILDING_RESEARCH_LAB_DESCRIPTION', '10% [ICON_Science] Science in this City.', 'en_US'),
('LOC_BUILDING_TEMPLE_OF_LEAVES_DESCRIPTION', '20% [ICON_Culture] Culture in this City. Can slot an additional Bard. +1 [ICON_Amenities]Amenity from [ICON_RESOURCE_INCENSE]Incense. +1 [ICON_Amenities]Amenity with the Religion Policy. Required to train Disciple and Priest of the Leaves. Triples the chance of Treant spawning to defend Ancient Forests*.', 'en_US'),
('LOC_BUILDING_SHIPYARD_DESCRIPTION', 'Naval units are granted +32 experience. +25% production towards Naval units in this city. Required to train Queen of the Line.', 'en_US'),
('LOC_BUILDING_SHRINE_DESCRIPTION', '10% [ICON_Culture] Culture in this City. +1 [ICON_Amenities]Amenity from [ICON_RESOURCE_INCENSE]Incense. +1 [ICON_Amenities]Amenity with the Religion Policy.', 'en_US'),
('LOC_BUILDING_SHRINE_OF_SIRONA_DESCRIPTION', 'Allows you to heal one of your units per turn.', 'en_US'),
('LOC_BUILDING_STABLE_DESCRIPTION', 'Required to train Horsemen, Horse Archers and Knights.', 'en_US'),
('LOC_BUILDING_TEMPLE_OF_THE_VEIL_DESCRIPTION', '20% [ICON_Culture] Culture in this City. Can slot an additional Sage. +1 [ICON_Amenities]Amenity from [ICON_RESOURCE_SPICES]Reagents. +1 [ICON_Amenities]Amenity with the Religion Policy. Required to train Savant, Ritualist and Beast of Agares.', 'en_US'),
('LOC_BUILDING_GRAND_MENAGERIE_DESCRIPTION', 'Grant a free Carnival in all cities. +2 [ICON_Amenities]Amenities per city. 20% [ICON_Culture] Culture in this City.', 'en_US'),
('LOC_BUILDING_WALLS_DESCRIPTION', 'While not as strong as Walls, Palisades provide a cheap defense of a city to fend off early aggression.', 'en_US'),
('LOC_BUILDING_TEMPLE_OF_KILMORPH_DESCRIPTION', '20% [ICON_Culture] Culture in this City. Can slot an additional Merchant. +1 [ICON_Amenities]Amenity from [ICON_RESOURCE_DIAMONDS]Gems. +1 [ICON_Amenities]Amenity with the Religion Policy. Required to train Thane, Stonewarden and Paramander.', 'en_US'),
('LOC_BUILDING_FORGE_DESCRIPTION', '25% [ICON_Production] Production in this City. Removes the Rusted promotion from units. +1 [ICON_Amenities]Amenity from [ICON_RESOURCE_GOLD]Gold.', 'en_US'),
('LOC_SLTH_BUILDING_ADVENTURERS_GUILD_DESCRIPTION', 'Grigori unique Building. 25% Great Person points generated per turn. Land units trained in this city get +16 experience.', 'en_US'),
('LOC_SLTH_BUILDING_ALTAR_OF_THE_LUONNOTAR_ANOINTED_DESCRIPTION', 'New Disciple units recieve +32 experience. Can support a Priest Specialist.', 'en_US'),
