('LOC_SLTH_BUILDING_ALTAR_OF_THE_LUONNOTAR_CONSECRATED_DESCRIPTION', '+2 [ICON_Amenities]Amenities in all your cities. +1 [ICON_Production]Production to all Priest Specialists and this city can host two more Priests. Free Blessed Ability for all Units produced in this city. New Disciple class Units trained in this city receive +33 experience.', 'en_US'),
('LOC_SLTH_BUILDING_ALTAR_OF_THE_LUONNOTAR_DESCRIPTION', 'Disciple units trained in this city gain +16 experience. Can support a Priest Specialist.', 'en_US'),
('LOC_SLTH_BUILDING_ALTAR_OF_THE_LUONNOTAR_DIVINE_DESCRIPTION', '+2 [ICON_Amenities]Amenities in all your cities. +2 [ICON_Production]Production to all Priest Specialists and this city can host two more Priests. Free Blessed Ability for all Units produced in this city. New Disciple class Units trained in this city receive +49 experience.', 'en_US'),
('LOC_SLTH_BUILDING_ALTAR_OF_THE_LUONNOTAR_EXALTED_DESCRIPTION', '+3 [ICON_Amenities]Amenities in all your cities. +2 [ICON_Production]Production to all Priest Specialists and this city can host two more Priests. Free Blessed Ability for all Units produced in this city. New Disciple class Units trained in this city receive +58 experience.', 'en_US'),
('LOC_SLTH_BUILDING_ALTAR_OF_THE_LUONNOTAR_FINAL_DESCRIPTION', '+3 [ICON_Amenities]Amenities in all your cities. +3 [ICON_Production]Production to all Priest Specialists. Free Blessed Ability for all Units produced in this city. New Disciple class Units trained in this city receive +67 experience. Starts a Golden Age.', 'en_US'),
