('LOC_SLTH_BUILDING_THE_DRAGONS_HORDE_DESCRIPTION', '+1 [ICON_RESOURCE_DIAMONDS]Gems resource. +1 [ICON_RESOURCE_GOLD]Gold resource. Grants Enchanted Blade ability to units trained in the city.', 'en_US'),
