('LOC_SLTH_BUILDING_TOWER_OF_NECROMANCY_DESCRIPTION', '+1 [ICON_RESOURCE_MANA_DEATH]Death Mana from city. All Undead units recieve +4[ICON_STRENGTH] Combat Strength. Can summon 5 additional Skeletons.[NEWLINE]Requires 4 Mana Resources: [ICON_RESOURCE_MANA_CHAOS]Chaos, [ICON_RESOURCE_MANA_DEATH]Death, [ICON_RESOURCE_MANA_ENTROPY]Entropy, [ICON_RESOURCE_MANA_SHADOW]Shadow.[NEWLINE]Required to build the Tower of Mastery, which wins the game', 'en_US'),
('LOC_SLTH_BUILDING_TOWER_OF_THE_ELEMENTS_DESCRIPTION', 'Elemental Summons have +4[ICON_STRENGTH] Combat Strength *. Summons a Elemental Guardian to defend this city.[NEWLINE]Requires 4 Mana Resources: [ICON_RESOURCE_MANA_AIR]Air, [ICON_RESOURCE_MANA_EARTH]Earth, [ICON_RESOURCE_MANA_FIRE]Fire, [ICON_RESOURCE_MANA_WATER]Water.[NEWLINE]Required to build the Tower of Mastery, which wins the game.', 'en_US'),
